8C%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B9%8B%E6%98%9F%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8D%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E9%98%9F%E9%95%BF%E6%98%9F%E7%8E%AF%E7%88%86%E5%8F%91%E6%97%B6%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%80%BC%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%8C%E6%98%9F%E7%8E%AF%E8%93%84%E8%83%BD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1758737514816\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/09/25/50494840/a96e6b3ae6a34987085126c9eba70a49_2320093290973158014.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>嗨♪爱愿妖精♥</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器。提高输出、辅助和循环能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【同调技能】提高敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤（独立加成、唯一生效）。嗨♪爱愿妖精♥装备时为敌人施加来自自身的冰易伤（独立加成）。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【通用性能】常驻全伤，佩戴者具有复盈相生特性时冰伤提高。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【角色相性】嗨♪爱愿妖精♥装备且激活星之环时，自身的冰伤、全易伤提高，全队全伤、提高，额外世界之星队伍的输出能力。作为队长星环爆发时能量初始值提高，星环蓄能状态下输出循环能力提高。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
